% The questions of LOMO's requirements document (its competency questions),
% as far as a description can answer them.
scenario description is, as stated in the source description:
    actions_of_rules expects answers ["description 1 produces item 1 action", "description 2 produces action 1", "description 2 produces item 2 action", "description 3 produces item 3 action", "description 4 produces action 3", "description 4 produces item 4 action", "description 5 produces action 4", "description 5 produces item 5 action", "description 6 produces item 6 action", "description 7 produces action 2", "description 7 produces item 7 action"].
    actions_of_agents expects answers ["competent authorities single point of contact acts as addressee in action 1", "developers acts as addresser in action 1", "developers competent authorities acts as addressee in item 2 action", "member states acts as addresser in action 2", "member states acts as addresser in action 3", "member states acts as addresser in action 4", "member states competent authorities acts as addressee in item 5 action", "member states competent authorities acts as addressee in item 6 action", "member states developers acts as addressee in item 1 action", "member states developers acts as addressee in item 7 action", "member states public developers acts as addressee in item 3 action", "member states public developers acts as addressee in item 4 action", "other member states authorities acts as addressee in action 4", "public developers acts as addressee in action 2", "public stakeholders acts as addressee in action 3"].

